<title>MALAYSIA: Malaysia Jan industrial production up 11.9 pct.</title>
<headline>Malaysia Jan industrial production up 11.9 pct.</headline>
<dateline>KUALA LUMPUR 1997-03-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Malaysia's industrial production index rose 11.9 percent year-on-year in January, the Statistics Department said on Friday.</p>
<p>On a month-on-month basis, the index was up 1.4 percent.</p>
<p>INDUSTRIAL PRODUCTION INDEX</p>
<p>January 1997  - 253.0</p>
<p>December 1996 - 249.5</p>
<p>January 1996  - 226.1</p>
<p>-- Kuala Lumpur newsroom (603-230 8911)</p>
